# Copy to apps/api/.env.local (gitignored). The api server needs none of
# these locally; the defaults in src/common/local-defaults.ts match
# `pnpm infra:up`.

# Market data loaders (`pnpm --filter @astraq/api symbols:sync`, `bootstrap`,
# `calendar:sync`) require these. The api server reads them too, optionally:
# with keys a newly watched symbol gets its candles loaded on the spot and
# the exchange calendar keeps itself loaded; without them it serves what's
# stored, and the session clock knows weekends but not holidays. Free keys: https://app.alpaca.markets -> API Keys
# (paper account keys work).
ALPACA_API_KEY_ID=
ALPACA_API_SECRET_KEY=
# Optional: `sip` (default, all US exchanges) or `iex`.
# ALPACA_FEED=sip
# Optional: the trading API host for the asset list. Live keys need
# https://api.alpaca.markets; paper keys use the default.
# ALPACA_TRADING_URL=https://paper-api.alpaca.markets

# Where bars and corporate actions come from. Unset: Alpaca when the keys
# above are set, otherwise nothing. `yahoo` needs no keys and is meant for
# a local database: unofficial, prices to the cent, no dividend pay dates.
# The symbol list and the exchange calendar need Alpaca either way.
# MARKET_DATA_PROVIDER=yahoo
